      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just to add an additional note for some people who use these...\n- If your avatar comes with sitting or lying down animations, bringing upthe oculus menu can pull you out of that animation, so you have to reset the position every time.\nThen only one button is pressed for the vrchat quick menu to see the time you have... instead of several buttons to use the oculus method and resetting your avatar's animation position.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
