      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't get why this is still not a thing.  Knowing the time is kind of a crucial thing for life in the modern world.  Expecting people to tab out of vrchat to see the time is stupid.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-11-09T12:47:59.215Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "On the quick menu, where the fps and ping counters are displayed, how about an in-game clock that's tied to the user's local time and positioned either center or right, at the top.\nSaves having to briefly bring up oculus menu to see the time.",
